OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff begin five-week
OL,4,Astrike on day one of new term
OL,5,
OL,6,FLecturers at the University of Dundee
OL,7,Fare beginning an unprecedented
OL,8,Ffive-week strike over the threat of
OL,9,Fcompulsory redundancies.
OL,11,FMembers of the UCU union will not take
OL,12,Fpart in lectures, seminars or tutorials
OL,13,Funtil after 23 October.
OL,15,FThe vote for "last resort" industrial
OL,16,Faction was the latest move in a
OL,17,Flong-running dispute which started
OL,18,Falmost two years ago when the
OL,19,Funiversity announced a #30m deficit.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
