OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity staff begin five-week
OL,4,Astrike on day one of new term
OL,5,
OL,6,FSince then, 675 jobs have been lost
OL,7,Fthrough voluntary redundancy, and the
OL,8,Funiversity has received bailouts of
OL,9,F#40m from the Scottish government and
OL,10,F#22m from the Scottish Funding Council.
